{"seq":12,"slug":"discourse-analysis","title":"话语分析","stage":"DONE","category":"linguistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 话语分析\n\n语言学的大部分历史，都在句号之内打转：音位怎样组合成词，词怎样按句法长成句子。可一旦句号落下，真实的语言生活才刚刚开始——一段对话、一篇社论、一条带配图的帖子、医生与病人的一次问诊。话语分析（discourse analysis）就是把研究单位从「句子」扩展到「使用中的语言」的那门学科：它关心句子之间如何连成一个整体，关心人们用语言在彼此之间做了什么事，关心同一段文字背后藏着谁的立场、服务于谁的利益。\n\n这个 hub 按四条主线递进展开，每一条都比上一条把镜头拉得更远。\n\n第一条是「基础」。在动手分析任何真实材料之前，得先有一套概念地基：话语与文本的区别、让一串句子读起来不散架的衔接与连贯机制、以及不同体裁各自约定俗成的结构骨架。这三件事是后面所有章节默认共享的词汇表，所以放在最前面。\n\n第二条是「会话分析」。把镜头对准最日常也最被忽视的语料——人们面对面随口说出的话。会话分析发现，看似杂乱的口语其实有极精密的微观秩序：话轮如何在毫秒级精度上交接、说错了怎样自我修正、问与答如何成对出现、为什么拒绝总是吞吞吐吐而接受总是干脆。这一章证明，秩序不一定来自语法规则，也可以来自互动本身。\n\n第三条是「批评与功能」。语言从不中立。批评话语分析追问文本如何再生产权力与意识形态，系统功能语言学提供了一套把「语法选择」直接连到「社会功能」的工具，叙事分析则揭示人们如何用讲故事来建构身份与意义。这一章把话语放回它所处的社会与认知语境里。\n\n第四条是「当代」。当语料从纸面走向屏幕、从手工标注走向算力规模，方法论本身被改写了。多模态分析处理图文音视频交织的意义，语料库与计算方法让分析能在数百万词的尺度上展开，而到了 2025–2026 年，大语言模型既成了分析对象，也成了分析工具，把这门学科推到了一个充满机遇与争议的前沿。\n\n四条主线不是四个抽屉，而是一条由近及远、由微观到宏观、由手工到计算的连续光谱。读完会发现：无论镜头拉到多远，话语分析始终在回答同一个朴素的问题——超越句子，语言在真实使用中究竟在做什么。\n\n各章的具体范围与彼此关系，见每一章开头的引言。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"intro-and-core-concepts","title":"话语分析导论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/foundations/intro-and-core-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cohesion-coherence","title":"衔接与连贯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/foundations/cohesion-coherence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"genre-text-structure","title":"语篇结构与体裁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/foundations/genre-text-structure"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"conversation-analysis","title":"会话分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/conversation-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ca-principles-turn-taking","title":"会话分析原理与话轮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/conversation-analysis/ca-principles-turn-taking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"repair-sequence-preference","title":"修正、序列与偏好","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/conversation-analysis/repair-sequence-preference"},{"seq":3,"slug":"speech-acts-interactional-pragmatics","title":"言语行为与互动语用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/conversation-analysis/speech-acts-interactional-pragmatics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"critical-functional","title":"批评与功能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/critical-functional","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"critical-discourse-analysis","title":"批评话语分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/critical-functional/critical-discourse-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"systemic-functional-linguistics","title":"系统功能语言学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/critical-functional/systemic-functional-linguistics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"narrative-analysis","title":"叙事分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/critical-functional/narrative-analysis"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"contemporary","title":"当代","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/contemporary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multimodal-discourse","title":"多模态话语分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/contemporary/multimodal-discourse"},{"seq":2,"slug":"corpus-computational-discourse","title":"语料库与计算话语分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/contemporary/corpus-computational-discourse"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-discourse-frontiers","title":"数字话语与前沿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/discourse-analysis/contemporary/digital-discourse-frontiers"}]}]}